  "changes_since_previous_candidate": [
    {
      "id": "p00926-69f375d99aed",
      "source": "Hamlet doesn't understand how to rule on his own. He's never had the head for it. But he's damn well willing to try.",
      "source_sha256": "69f375d99aed2aae901dd8b7886c18657189f7840a1b3d2a124e556da4431131",
      "previous_target": "哈姆雷特不懂如何独自治国。他从来就没有这方面的头脑。但他还真他妈愿意试一试。",
      "target": "哈姆雷特不懂如何独自治国。他从来就没有这方面的头脑。可是，妈的，他就是愿意试一试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p00941-3dd934ed0356",
      "source": "Without thinking, I strip myself of my cloak and surcoat and with my meager weight pull him as far up the bank as I can. His feet find purchase, and he stumbles up onto the shore.",
      "source_sha256": "3dd934ed035673d1233bd88536d14863ea898c00ea6aa8cdef5a2117b20fa5ab",
      "previous_target": "我不假思索地脱下披风和外衣，用自己轻微的体重，尽力把他往岸上拉。他的双脚终于有了着力处，踉跄着爬上了岸。",
      "target": "我不假思索地脱下披风和外衣，借着自己那点体重，尽力把他往岸上拉。他的双脚终于有了着力处，踉跄着爬上了岸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p00964-4197d8fc51e7",
      "source": "The Queen is dead. Long live the Queen.\nIf I sat on the throne, I could create nearly any world I liked.\nBut that sort of power comes with a price.",
      "source_sha256": "4197d8fc51e7e2b7ff9ea01609c46a2e4a86dee05c606859d41e7addeefe899e",
      "previous_target": "女王已死。女王万岁。\n如果我坐上王位，几乎就能创造任何我想要的世界。\n但这样的权力，是有代价的。",
      "target": "王后已死。女王万岁。\n如果我坐上王位，几乎就能创造任何我想要的世界。\n但这样的权力，是有代价的。"
    },
